  <h2 id="next">Try the next skill</h2>
  <p>When a security finding points at a specific user, hand off to <a href={join('/tutorials/ha-debug/')}>ha-debug</a> for full per-user state across Cognito and DynamoDB — account metadata, connection details, and recent session history in one case file.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
